      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not define “jabberwocky” as “sentence-like language material that preserves syntactic structure while lacking normal lexical-semantic meaning.” It only refers to “syntactic structures in the absence of lexical semantics” in the context of comparing natural language vs “jabberwocky materials,” without explicitly characterizing jabberwocky as preserving syntactic structure but removing lexical-semantic meaning.",
